{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_7_async_03_microtasks_vs_macrotasks_01_the_drain_order_microtask", "label": "Microtask", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-7-async/03-microtasks-vs-macrotasks/01-the-drain-order.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Created by .then/.catch/.finally, await continuations, queueMicrotask, MutationObserver. Entire queue drains after the current task."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_7_async_03_microtasks_vs_macrotasks_01_the_drain_order_task", "label": "Task (macrotask)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-7-async/03-microtasks-vs-macrotasks/01-the-drain-order.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One job per event-loop turn. Created by setTimeout, setInterval, event dispatch, the initial script. A task yields; a microtask does not."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_7_async_03_microtasks_vs_macrotasks_01_the_drain_order_drain_until_empty", "label": "Microtask drain until empty", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-7-async/03-microtasks-vs-macrotasks/01-the-drain-order.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A task runs one job. A microtask drain runs every microtask, including ones queued during the drain."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_7_async_03_microtasks_vs_macrotasks_01_the_drain_order_microtask_starvation", "label": "Microtask starvation", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-7-async/03-microtasks-vs-macrotasks/01-the-drain-order.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A self-re-arming microtask chain never returns to the task queue \u2014 no timers, events or rendering. Worse than while(true) because it looks async."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_7_async_03_microtasks_vs_macrotasks_01_the_drain_order_await_is_microtask", "label": "await is microtask scheduling", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-7-async/03-microtasks-vs-macrotasks/01-the-drain-order.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Code before the first await is synchronous. await on a non-promise still yields a microtask, never a task, so an await loop still starves rendering."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_7_async_03_microtasks_vs_macrotasks_01_the_drain_order_rendering_between_tasks", "label": "Rendering between tasks", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-7-async/03-microtasks-vs-macrotasks/01-the-drain-order.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The browser schedules a rendering opportunity between tasks, after the microtask queue is empty. Yield a task to paint."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_7_async_03_microtasks_vs_macrotasks_01_the_drain_order_requestanimationframe", "label": "requestAnimationFrame", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-7-async/03-microtasks-vs-macrotasks/01-the-drain-order.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Neither a task nor a microtask \u2014 a separate callback list in the rendering step, just before layout and paint."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_7_async_03_microtasks_vs_macrotasks_01_the_drain_order_process_nexttick", "label": "process.nextTick", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-7-async/03-microtasks-vs-macrotasks/01-the-drain-order.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Node-only queue drained before the promise microtask queue. setImmediate is a check-phase task."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_7_async_03_microtasks_vs_macrotasks_01_the_drain_order_mdn_microtask_guide", "label": "MDN Using microtasks in JavaScript", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-7-async/03-microtasks-vs-macrotasks/01-the-drain-order.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": "https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/HTML_DOM_API/Microtask_guide", "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_7_async_03_microtasks_vs_macrotasks_01_the_drain_order_microtask", "target": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_7_async_03_microtasks_vs_macrotasks_01_the_drain_order_task", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-7-async/03-microtasks-vs-macrotasks/01-the-drain-order.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_7_async_03_microtasks_vs_macrotasks_01_the_drain_order_drain_until_empty", "target": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_7_async_03_microtasks_vs_macrotasks_01_the_drain_order_microtask", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-7-async/03-microtasks-vs-macrotasks/01-the-drain-order.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_7_async_03_microtasks_vs_macrotasks_01_the_drain_order_microtask_starvation", "target": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_7_async_03_microtasks_vs_macrotasks_01_the_drain_order_drain_until_empty", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-7-async/03-microtasks-vs-macrotasks/01-the-drain-order.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs